# A screw thread that doesn't fit its part (an extension): run off the
# extruded circle's top, refused; run down into it but longer than it,
# refused; then shorter than the part, made.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# Up from the top circle: no part there.
answer ok
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part. but 500 long.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 500
answer ok
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
tw
dump
# Shorter than the part: made.
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 20
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
tw
dump
